return ['domain'=>'zinn-cache','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_CN','project-id-version'=>'zinn-cache','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-01T23:46:22+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-01T23:46:22+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Cache'=>'Zinn® Cache','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache','A page cache and a Redis object cache for any WordPress site. Uses the LiteSpeed server cache where there is one and its own disk cache everywhere else, purges only what a change affects, and proves its Redis connection works.'=>'适用于任何 WordPress 站点的页面缓存和 Redis 对象缓存。在有 LiteSpeed 服务器缓存的地方使用它，在其他地方使用自带的磁盘缓存，仅清理受更改影响的内容，并验证其 Redis 连接是否正常工作。','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Cache'=>'缓存','Page cache'=>'页面缓存','Object cache'=>'对象缓存','Purging'=>'正在清除','Exclusions'=>'排除项','AI agents (MCP)'=>'AI 代理 (MCP)','Purge everything now'=>'立即清除全部','Every cached page is discarded and will be rebuilt as visitors arrive. Continue?'=>'所有缓存的页面将被废弃，并在访客访问时重新生成。您要继续吗？','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'允许 AI 代理 (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'关闭：以下工具及其 REST 路由完全未注册。','Full-page cache'=>'全页缓存','On a LiteSpeed server, pages are served by the web server before WordPress runs. On any other server, this plugin stores each page as a file and serves it before WordPress loads. This is where nearly all the speed comes from.'=>'在 LiteSpeed 服务器上，页面在 WordPress 运行之前由 Web 服务器提供。在任何其他服务器上，此插件都会将每个页面存储为一个文件，并在 WordPress 加载之前提供它。几乎所有的速度提升都来源于此。','Cache pages for visitors who are not signed in'=>'为未登录的访客缓存页面','How long a page stays cached'=>'页面在缓存中保留的时间','Seconds. A week suits most sites; a news site publishing hourly wants far less.'=>'秒。一周适用于大多数站点；每小时发布一次的新闻站点所需的时间则要少得多。','How long a visitor’s browser keeps images and scripts'=>'访客的浏览器保留图像和脚本的时长','Seconds. Applies to images, CSS and JavaScript only — never to pages. Set to 0 to leave this to your host.'=>'秒。仅适用于图像、CSS 和 JavaScript，绝不适用于页面。设置为 0 则交由您的主机处理。','Signed-in visitors'=>'已登录访客','Never serve a cached page to a signed-in visitor'=>'绝不向已登录的访客提供缓存页面','On is the safe answer and the default. Turn it off only if you know every cached page is identical for every signed-in user — a membership site is the usual reason not to.'=>'“开启”是安全且默认的选项。仅在您明确知道所有已登录用户所看到的每个缓存页面均完全相同的情况下，才将其关闭——会员网站通常是不应关闭的原因。','Different lifetimes for different content'=>'针对不同内容的不同生命周期','For example: a shop’s product pages for an hour, while everything else stays a week.'=>'例如：商店的产品页面保留一小时，而其他所有内容保留一周。','Add a rule'=>'添加规则','Content type'=>'内容类型','Seconds'=>'秒','Object cache (Redis)'=>'对象缓存 (Redis)','Your host runs a private Redis object cache for this site and keeps it configured. There is nothing to set up here; the status at the top of this screen shows whether it is working.'=>'您的主机为此站点运行专用的 Redis 对象缓存并保持其配置。此处无需进行任何设置；此屏幕顶部的状态显示其是否正在正常工作。','Caches the results of database queries. It helps most on a busy shop or a site with a lot of signed-in traffic, where the page cache cannot.'=>'缓存数据库查询的结果。这在繁忙的商店或有大量已登录用户流量的网站上最有用，因为页面缓存无法对此类情况提供帮助。','Install the Redis object-cache drop-in'=>'安装 Redis 对象缓存 drop-in','Needs the phpredis extension. If it is missing, the box above this screen says so.'=>'需要 phpredis 扩展。如果缺少，此屏幕上方的框中会进行说明。','Redis host'=>'Redis 主机','Redis port'=>'Redis 端口','Redis database'=>'Redis 数据库','Give each site on a shared Redis its own number, or they will clear each other’s cache.'=>'请为共享 Redis 上的每个站点分配独立的编号，否则它们会互相清除对方的缓存。','Redis username'=>'Redis 用户名','Only for a Redis server with ACL users (Redis 6 or later). Leave blank to sign in with the password alone.'=>'仅适用于具有 ACL 用户的 Redis 服务器（Redis 6 或更高版本）。留空以仅使用密码登录。','Redis password'=>'Redis 密码','Leave blank if your Redis does not need one.'=>'如果您的 Redis 不需要，请留空。','Key prefix'=>'密钥前缀','An alternative to a separate database number when you cannot have one.'=>'当您无法拥有独立的数据库编号时的替代方案。','Smart auto-purge'=>'智能自动清理','Clear affected pages automatically when content changes'=>'内容发生更改时自动清除受影响的页面','After updates'=>'更新后','Clear everything after a core, plugin or theme update'=>'在核心、插件或主题更新后清除全部内容','After a comment'=>'在评论之后','Clear a post’s page when a comment on it is approved'=>'当文章的评论获批时清除该文章页面','Turn this off on a very busy comment section, where it can clear the same page hundreds of times an hour.'=>'在评论非常活跃的版块中请关闭此项，否则它可能会在一小时内清除同一页面数百次。','Never cache these'=>'绝不缓存这些','Sensible WordPress and WooCommerce defaults are always applied — cart, checkout, my-account and any signed-in session are never cached, whatever is below.'=>'合理的 WordPress 和 WooCommerce 默认设置始终适用——无论下方设置如何，cart、checkout、my-account 以及任何已登录的会话都绝不会被缓存。','Addresses'=>'地址','One path per line, for example <code>/basket</code>. A trailing <code>*</code> matches everything under it.'=>'每行一个路径，例如 <code>/basket</code>。末尾的 <code>*</code> 匹配其下的所有内容。','Query parameters'=>'查询参数','A page carrying one of these is never cached — for example a one-time preview token.'=>'包含其中之一的页面绝不会被缓存 — 例如一次性预览令牌。','Cookies'=>'Cookie','A visitor carrying one of these is always served a fresh page.'=>'携带其中之一的访客始终会获取到一个新生成的页面。','Every cached page has been discarded. They will be rebuilt as visitors arrive.'=>'所有缓存页面已被舍弃。访客访问时将重新生成。','The object cache is installed, but it is not storing anything.'=>'对象缓存已安装，但未存储任何内容。','The page cache is on, but pages are not being stored yet.'=>'页面缓存已开启，但页面尚未被存储。','WordPress has not loaded the page-cache drop-in yet. It starts on the next page load; if it does not, check that WP_CACHE is true in wp-config.php.'=>'WordPress 尚未加载页面缓存 drop-in。它将在下次页面加载时启动；如果没有启动，请检查 wp-config.php 中的 WP_CACHE 是否为 true。','The object cache is on, but this server has no Redis support.'=>'对象缓存已启用，但此服务器不支持 Redis。','The phpredis extension is not installed, so the drop-in cannot be used and WordPress is falling back to its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis.'=>'未安装 phpredis 扩展，因此无法使用 drop-in，WordPress 正回退至其自身的内存缓存。请要求您的主机服务商启用 phpredis。','Nothing is being cached.'=>'未缓存任何内容。','Both caches are switched off, so this plugin is not making the site any faster.'=>'两个缓存均已关闭，因此此插件并未提高网站速度。','Caching is active on this site.'=>'此站点已启用缓存。','Redis refused the username or password. Check the Redis credentials in wp-config.php or on this screen.'=>'Redis 拒绝了用户名或密码。请在 wp-config.php 中或在此屏幕上检查 Redis 凭据。','Redis accepted the login but does not allow this site to store its keys. The Redis user needs permission for this site\'s key prefix.'=>'Redis 已接受登录，但不允许此站点存储其键。Redis 用户需要此站点键前缀的权限。','Redis refused the database number. Check the Redis database setting.'=>'Redis 拒绝了数据库编号。请检查 Redis 数据库设置。','Redis is out of memory and is refusing new data.'=>'Redis 内存不足，正在拒绝新数据。','The phpredis extension is not installed, so WordPress is using its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis.'=>'未安装 phpredis 扩展，因此 WordPress 正在使用其自身的内存缓存。请要求您的主机服务提供商启用 phpredis。','WP_REDIS_DISABLED is set in wp-config.php, so the object cache is switched off.'=>'wp-config.php 中设置了 WP_REDIS_DISABLED，因此对象缓存已关闭。','The Redis server could not be reached. Check the Redis host and port, and that Redis is running.'=>'无法连接到 Redis 服务器。请检查 Redis 主机和端口，并确保 Redis 正在运行。','Redis did not return the value that was just written to it. Check the Redis server\'s logs.'=>'Redis 未返回刚刚写入其中的值。请检查 Redis 服务器的日志。','Web server'=>'Web 服务器','LiteSpeed — pages are cached by the web server'=>'LiteSpeed — 页面由 Web 服务器缓存','not LiteSpeed — pages are cached on disk by this plugin'=>'非 LiteSpeed — 页面由此插件缓存在磁盘上','Pages stored on disk'=>'磁盘上存储的页面','Redis support'=>'Redis 支持','phpredis is installed'=>'phpredis 已安装','phpredis is not installed'=>'phpredis 未安装','Page lifetime'=>'页面生命周期','You are not allowed to purge the cache.'=>'您没有清除缓存的权限。','Cache purge requested.'=>'已请求清除缓存。','Zinn® Cache: another object-cache drop-in is installed, so the Redis object cache is not managed by this plugin.'=>'Zinn® Cache：已安装另一个 object-cache drop-in，因此此插件不管理 Redis 对象缓存。','detected'=>'已检测到','not detected'=>'未检测到','phpredis extension missing'=>'缺少 phpredis 扩展','installed, not storing anything'=>'已安装，未存储任何内容','active, managed by your host'=>'已启用，由您的托管主机管理','active'=>'有效','inactive'=>'未激活','LiteSpeed cache:'=>'LiteSpeed 缓存：','Redis object cache:'=>'Redis 对象缓存：','The Redis PHP extension (phpredis) is not available on this server, so the object cache cannot be enabled.'=>'此服务器上没有 Redis PHP 扩展 (phpredis)，因此无法启用对象缓存。','Another object-cache drop-in is already installed. Remove it before enabling the Zinn® object cache.'=>'已安装另一个 object-cache drop-in。请在启用 Zinn® 对象缓存之前将其移除。','Could not write the Redis connection configuration file.'=>'无法写入 Redis 连接配置文件。','The bundled object-cache drop-in could not be read.'=>'无法读取捆绑的 object-cache drop-in。','Could not install the object-cache drop-in into wp-content.'=>'无法将 object-cache drop-in 安装到 wp-content 中。','Could not remove the object-cache drop-in.'=>'无法移除 object-cache drop-in。','The WordPress filesystem is not writable, so the object-cache drop-in could not be managed.'=>'WordPress 文件系统不可写，因此无法管理 object-cache drop-in。','Another page-cache plugin has installed wp-content/advanced-cache.php. Remove that plugin first, or keep using its page cache.'=>'另一个页面缓存插件已安装 wp-content/advanced-cache.php。请先移除该插件，或继续使用其页面缓存。','The folder wp-content/cache/zinn-cache could not be written, so pages cannot be cached.'=>'文件夹 wp-content/cache/zinn-cache 无法写入，因此页面无法被缓存。','wp-content/advanced-cache.php could not be written, so pages cannot be cached.'=>'无法写入 wp-content/advanced-cache.php，因此无法缓存页面。','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'查看 Zinn Digital® 发行说明。','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Zinn® 更新服务未提供此更新的下载链接。请检查此站点是否能够连接到 Zinn® 平台，然后重试。','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'无法从 Zinn® 更新服务（%s）下载更新。请在几分钟后重试。','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'下载的更新未能通过完整性检查，未被安装。','Go Pro'=>'升级至 Pro','A cache analytics screen: hit ratio, memory, keys and the slowest cache commands.'=>'缓存分析屏幕：命中率、内存、键以及最慢的缓存命令。','A slow-query and uncached-call finder that names the plugin or theme responsible.'=>'慢查询与未缓存调用查找工具，可指出造成问题的插件或主题。','An in-memory APCu tier in front of Redis for the hottest keys, plus prefetching, compression and the igbinary serializer.'=>'位于 Redis 前端的内存中 APCu 层，用于最常访问的热点键，并支持预取、压缩以及 igbinary 序列化器。','Tag-based purging for posts, terms and WooCommerce products, so only what changed is cleared, with the page and object caches purged together.'=>'针对文章、分类法词条及 WooCommerce 产品的基于标签的缓存清理，仅清除发生变更的内容，并同步清理页面缓存与对象缓存。','Automatic cache warm-up after a purge, WebP and AVIF images, unused-CSS removal and delayed JavaScript.'=>'清除后自动预热缓存、WebP 和 AVIF 图像、移除未使用的 CSS 以及延迟 JavaScript。','Scheduled database clean-up with a preview, and per-page cache rules.'=>'具有预览功能的定时数据库清理，以及按页面配置的缓存规则。','Cache health alerts in your Zinn Digital® dashboard when the hit ratio drops or memory fills.'=>'当命中率下降或内存占满时，您 Zinn Digital® 仪表盘中的缓存健康警报。','Everything on the other tabs is free and stays free. Pro installs on top of this plugin and adds:'=>'其他标签页上的所有内容都是免费的，并将保持免费。Pro 安装在此插件之上，并添加：','See what Pro costs'=>'查看 Pro 版价格','Every plan starts with a 14-day free trial, no card needed: %1$s a year for one site, %2$s for five sites, %3$s for unlimited sites.'=>'每个方案均提供 14 天免费试用，无需绑定信用卡：%1$s/年（1 个站点），%2$s（5 个站点），%3$s（无限制站点）。','wp-config.php was not found, so WP_CACHE could not be turned on. Add define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); to it.'=>'未找到 wp-config.php，因此无法开启 WP_CACHE。请将 define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); 添加到其中。','wp-config.php already defines WP_CACHE as false, so the page cache cannot start. Change it to true.'=>'wp-config.php 已将 WP_CACHE 定义为 false，因此页面缓存无法启动。请将其更改为 true。','wp-config.php is not writable, so WP_CACHE could not be turned on. Add define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); to it.'=>'wp-config.php 文件不可写，因此无法开启 WP_CACHE。请将 define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); 添加到其中。','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'已存储。键入新值以替换它。','Filter this list…'=>'筛选此列表…','Filter this list'=>'筛选此列表','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'没有任何内容符合该筛选条件。','Add a row'=>'添加行','Remove this row'=>'移除此行','Remove'=>'移除','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — 概览','Overview'=>'概览','Copied'=>'已复制','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'此站点上的每个 Zinn® 插件，以及它是否正常运行。','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'此插件不需要任何连接。','Open settings'=>'打开设置','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'您没有权限更改这些设置。','Settings sections'=>'设置部分','Support'=>'支持','Save changes'=>'保存更改','Tools'=>'工具','Export settings'=>'导出设置','Reset to defaults'=>'恢复为默认值','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'这将把此插件的每项设置恢复为默认值。要继续吗？','Diagnostics for support'=>'支持诊断信息','Import a settings file'=>'导入设置文件','Import'=>'导入','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'导出的文件绝不包含密码、令牌或 API 密钥 — 您需要重新在新的站点上输入它们。','Settings saved.'=>'设置已保存。','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'此插件上的所有设置均已恢复为其默认值。','Done.'=>'完成。','That action is not available.'=>'该操作不可用。','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'无法读取该文件。请选择从 Zinn® 插件导出的设置文件。','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'该文件过大，无法作为设置导出文件。','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'该文件不是 Zinn® 设置导出文件。','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'该文件是从其他插件 (%s) 导出的，因此在此处导入它将保存该插件无法识别的设置。','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'已导入 %d 项设置。密码和 API 密钥绝不会包含在导出文件中，因此请重新输入它们。','Connected'=>'已连接','Connecting…'=>'正在连接…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'已连接，但有事项需要注意','Not connected'=>'未连接','Running on your own account'=>'在您自己的账户上运行','We could not check this'=>'我们无法检查此项','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'此插件未说明原因。请发送诊断报告，我们将进行查看。','Connection status'=>'连接状态','Last checked %s ago.'=>'上次检查于 %s 前。','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(在新标签页中打开)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'将此发送至 Zinn® 支持团队','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'将要发送的内容正是这些 — 没有其他内容，也没有任何隐藏信息。您的密码、令牌和 API 密钥均不包含在内。','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'将要发送的诊断报告','Copy to clipboard'=>'复制到剪贴板','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'将此报告发送至 Zinn® 支持团队','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'我们为您开立支持工单并通过电子邮件回复。如果您不希望发送，请复制上方内容并自行粘贴至工单中。','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'我们无法从此服务器（%s）访问 Zinn Digital®。请复制上方的报告并提交工单——您的设置没有任何问题。','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'已发送。Zinn® 支持团队已收到您的报告，并将通过电子邮件予以回复。','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'已发送。Zinn® 支持团队已收到您的报告 — 参考编号 %s — 并将通过电子邮件回复。','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'您在短时间内发送了多份报告。请等待几分钟后再试 — 先前的报告已送达。','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® 刚才无法接收报告——这是我们方面的问题，并非您的问题。请稍后重试，或将上述报告复制到工单中。','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'报告已被拒绝 (HTTP %d)。请复制上方内容并提交工单，附上该编号。','Hosting customer? Get %1$d%% off %2$s'=>'您是托管客户吗？获取 %2$s 的 %1$d%% 折扣','As a Zinn Digital® hosting customer you get a personal code for %d%% off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'作为 Zin