'=>'试用','verbOpt In'=>'选择加入','verbOpt Out'=>'退出','verbSkip'=>'跳过','verbUpgrade'=>'升级','x-ago%s ago'=>'%s前','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'该操作无法完成。请重试，如果仍然失败，请与站点管理员联系。','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'缺少必填值或其格式有误。请检查该能力的输入架构（input schema）。','The site refused the request.'=>'该站点拒绝了请求。','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user with an application password and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'允许 Claude、Cursor 或 VS Code 等 AI 助手通过 MCP (Model Context Protocol) 为您在此网站上工作。它们使用应用程序密码作为 WordPress 用户登录，并且只能执行该用户被允许执行的操作。','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'AI 智能体需要 WordPress 6.9 或更高版本。请更新 WordPress 以使用它们。','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'连接地址 (MCP 端点)','Create an application password for your user'=>'为您的用户创建应用程序密码','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'请将此内容以及您的用户名和该密码添加到您的 AI 应用的 MCP 设置中：','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code：请将相同的条目放在 .vscode/mcp.json 中的 "servers" 下，而不是 "mcpServers" 下。','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'AI 代理在此处可以使用的工具 (%d)：','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'用户指南：AI 智能体与 MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'开发者文档：能力、REST 和 MCP','Check and purge this site\'s cache and change its cache settings with Zinn® Cache.'=>'使用 Zinn® Cache 检查并清除此站点的缓存，并更改其缓存设置。','Page and object cache status, purging and settings.'=>'页面与对象缓存状态、清除和设置。','Read the cache status'=>'读取缓存状态','Returns whether the page cache and the object cache are on and working, how many pages are cached, and the object cache\'s connection and hit numbers.'=>'返回页面缓存与对象缓存是否开启且正常工作、已缓存的页面数量，以及对象缓存的连接数与命中数。','Read the cache settings'=>'读取缓存设置','Returns every cache setting. The Redis password is never returned, only whether one is saved.'=>'返回每项缓存设置。绝不会返回 Redis 密码，仅返回是否已保存密码。','Change the cache settings'=>'更改缓存设置','Changes the settings you send and keeps the rest (page cache, how long pages stay cached, the object cache and its Redis connection, purging rules and exclusions). Values are checked and corrected exactly as on the Cache screen.'=>'更改您发送的设置并保留其余设置（页面缓存、页面缓存保留时间、对象缓存及其 Redis 连接、清除规则和排除项）。系统会严格按照“缓存”屏幕上的方式检查并纠正这些值。','Put the cache settings back to their defaults'=>'将缓存设置恢复为默认值','Puts every cache setting back to its default, as the Reset button does. The saved Redis password is removed too.'=>'将所有缓存设置恢复为默认值，效果与“重置”按钮相同。已保存的 Redis 密码也将被移除。','Read the diagnostics report'=>'阅读诊断报告','Returns the diagnostics report support asks for: versions, server limits, the cache state and recent errors. It holds no passwords or keys.'=>'返回支持团队所需的诊断报告：版本、服务器限制、缓存状态以及最近的错误。它不包含任何密码或密钥。','Purge the cache'=>'清除缓存','Discards cached pages: everything (all: true), some addresses (urls) or everything tagged (tags). Pages are rebuilt as visitors arrive.'=>'清除缓存页面：全部 (all: true)、部分地址 (urls) 或包含特定标签的所有内容 (tags)。页面将在访客访问时重新生成。']];